/// Pkl libraries for the configuration of Benthos distributions.
///
/// A pipeline of Benthos, of Bento, or of Redpanda Connect is described using
/// a YAML file. These libraries let you write one in Pkl instead, so that an
/// editor completes a field name, and Pkl reports a wrong value where you
/// write it.
///
/// Each library holds the components of one release of one build, and comes
/// from the configuration schema that the release publishes. Pick the version
/// that matches the build you run.
///
/// The generator is at https://github.com/pauloborges/pklbenthos.
amends "pkl:DocsiteInfo"

title = "pklbenthos"
